{"seq":1,"slug":"triads","title":"三和弦的构成与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/triads","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"三和弦的构成与分类\">三和弦的构成与分类</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三和弦是西方和声体系最基本的纵向音响单位，由根音、三音、五音按三度叠置而成。理解它的关键在于分清三个音各自承担的角色：根音是命名基准与引力中心，三音决定大小调性质，五音巩固稳定性。由此出发，两个相邻三度的不同音程组合穷尽了全部四种三和弦类型，而调内各级三和弦的大小分布又直接来自音阶结构——这是后文所有进行、声部与色彩讨论的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三度叠置原理\">三度叠置原理</h2><p>三和弦（Triad）是由三个音按照三度音程关系叠置而成的和弦，是西方和声体系中最基本的纵向音响单位。三和弦包含三个组成部分：<strong>根音</strong>（Root）、<strong>三音</strong>（Third）、<strong>五音</strong>（Fifth）。</p>\n<p>根音是和弦的命名基准与引力中心；三音决定和弦的大小调性质（大三度 = 大和弦，小三度 = 小和弦）；五音巩固和弦的稳定性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>三和弦</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>根音</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>三音（根音上方三度）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>五音（三音上方三度）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{三和弦} = \\text{根音} + \\text{三音（根音上方三度）} + \\text{五音（三音上方三度）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三和弦</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">根音</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三音（根音上方三度）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">五音（三音上方三度）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;三和弦构成&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;根音 (Root)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;三音 (Third)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;五音 (Fifth)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;和弦命名基准&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;决定大/小性质&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;巩固稳定性&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"三和弦构成\"] --&gt; B[\"根音 (Root)\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"三音 (Third)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"五音 (Fifth)\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"和弦命名基准\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"决定大/小性质\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"巩固稳定性\"]</pre><h2 id=\"四种三和弦类型\">四种三和弦类型</h2><p>根据根音与三音、三音与五音之间的音程组合，三和弦有且仅有四种类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>和弦类型</th>\n<th>下方三度</th>\n<th>上方三度</th>\n<th>根音到五音</th>\n<th>音响色彩</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大三和弦 (Major)</td>\n<td>大三度 (4半音)</td>\n<td>小三度 (3半音)</td>\n<td>纯五度 (7半音)</td>\n<td>明亮、稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小三和弦 (Minor)</td>\n<td>小三度 (3半音)</td>\n<td>大三度 (4半音)</td>\n<td>纯五度 (7半音)</td>\n<td>柔和、忧郁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增三和弦 (Augmented)</td>\n<td>大三度 (4半音)</td>\n<td>大三度 (4半音)</td>\n<td>增五度 (8半音)</td>\n<td>紧张、不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减三和弦 (Diminished)</td>\n<td>小三度 (3半音)</td>\n<td>小三度 (3半音)</td>\n<td>减五度 (6半音)</td>\n<td>收缩、不安</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 C 为根音的四种三和弦：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext> Major</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\text{ Major} = C - E - G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Major</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext> Minor</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\text{ Minor} = C - E\\flat - G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Minor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext> Augmented</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\text{ Augmented} = C - E - G\\sharp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Augmented</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mtext> Diminished</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\text{ Diminished} = C - E\\flat - G\\flat</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Diminished</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>大三和弦与小三和弦因其纯五度框架而具有天然的稳定感，是调性音乐中的主力和弦。增三和弦与减三和弦因五音偏移而充满张力，通常起过渡或色彩作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调内三和弦的自然分布\">调内三和弦的自然分布</h2><p>在自然大调中，以每个音级为根音构建三和弦，会自然产生特定的大小分布模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级数</th>\n<th>罗马数字</th>\n<th>和弦性质</th>\n<th>C大调示例</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>大三</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>主功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II</td>\n<td>ii</td>\n<td>小三</td>\n<td>Dm</td>\n<td>下属功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>iii</td>\n<td>小三</td>\n<td>Em</td>\n<td>主功能（替代）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>大三</td>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>下属功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>大三</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>属功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VI</td>\n<td>vi</td>\n<td>小三</td>\n<td>Am</td>\n<td>主功能（替代）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VII</td>\n<td>vii°</td>\n<td>减三</td>\n<td>B°</td>\n<td>属功能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>标记惯例：大写罗马数字表示大三和弦，小写表示小三和弦，° 表示减三和弦，+ 表示增三和弦。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph C大调各级三和弦&#10;        I[&quot;I&lt;br/&gt;C 大三&quot;] --&gt; ii[&quot;ii&lt;br/&gt;Dm 小三&quot;]&#10;        ii --&gt; iii[&quot;iii&lt;br/&gt;Em 小三&quot;]&#10;        iii --&gt; IV[&quot;IV&lt;br/&gt;F 大三&quot;]&#10;        IV --&gt; V[&quot;V&lt;br/&gt;G 大三&quot;]&#10;        V --&gt; vi[&quot;vi&lt;br/&gt;Am 小三&quot;]&#10;        vi --&gt; vii[&quot;vii°&lt;br/&gt;B° 减三&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph C大调各级三和弦\n        I[\"I&lt;br/&gt;C 大三\"] --&gt; ii[\"ii&lt;br/&gt;Dm 小三\"]\n        ii --&gt; iii[\"iii&lt;br/&gt;Em 小三\"]\n        iii --&gt; IV[\"IV&lt;br/&gt;F 大三\"]\n        IV --&gt; V[\"V&lt;br/&gt;G 大三\"]\n        V --&gt; vi[\"vi&lt;br/&gt;Am 小三\"]\n        vi --&gt; vii[\"vii°&lt;br/&gt;B° 减三\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"三和弦的转位\">三和弦的转位</h2><p>转位（Inversion）是指将和弦中的非根音置于最低声部。三和弦有三种位置：</p>\n<p><strong>原位</strong>（Root Position）：根音在最低声部。标记：无特殊标记或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^5_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>第一转位</strong>（First Inversion）：三音在最低声部。标记：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^6_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二转位</strong>（Second Inversion）：五音在最低声部。标记：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^6_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C 原位</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext> 在底部</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C 原位} = C - E - G \\quad (C \\text{ 在底部})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在底部</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C 第一转位</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mtext> 在底部</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C 第一转位} = E - G - C \\quad (E \\text{ 在底部})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第一转位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在底部</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C 第二转位</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mtext> 在底部</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C 第二转位} = G - C - E \\quad (G \\text{ 在底部})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第二转位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在底部</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>转位不改变和弦的根音与功能属性，但改变了和弦的低音色彩与稳定性。原位最稳定，第一转位较轻盈，第二转位最不稳定（常用于经过或终止中的特殊位置）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转位</th>\n<th>低音</th>\n<th>数字低音</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原位</td>\n<td>根音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^5_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最稳定</td>\n<td>乐句起止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一转位</td>\n<td>三音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>线性低音行进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二转位</td>\n<td>五音</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^6_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最不稳定</td>\n<td>经过、终止准备</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"和弦标记系统比较\">和弦标记系统比较</h2><p>不同音乐传统使用不同的和弦标记系统：</p>\n<p><strong>古典标记（数字低音）</strong>：以罗马数字标注级数，上标数字标注转位。如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^6_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0622em;vertical-align:-0.2481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示属和弦的第二转位。</p>\n<p><strong>流行/爵士标记（和弦符号）</strong>：以字母标注根音，后缀标注性质。如 Cm 表示 C 小三和弦，Caug 或 C+ 表示 C 增三和弦。</p>\n<p><strong>斜杠和弦</strong>：用于标注转位或踏板低音。如 C/E 表示 C 大三和弦以 E 为低音（= 第一转位），C/G 表示以 G 为低音（= 第二转位）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>和弦</th>\n<th>古典标记</th>\n<th>流行标记</th>\n<th>Nashville 数字</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C大三原位</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G大三原位</td>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A小三原位</td>\n<td>vi</td>\n<td>Am</td>\n<td>6m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F大三第一转位</td>\n<td>IV⁶</td>\n<td>F/A</td>\n<td>4/6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Nashville Number System（纳什维尔数字体系）是录音棚乐手广泛使用的简化标记——用数字代替字母，使同一份和弦谱可以不加修改地在任何调中演奏。这一体系在 2020 年代的流行音乐制作中仍然活跃，特别是在现场录音环节中因其转调灵活性而备受青睐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三和弦 = 根音 + 三音 + 五音，按三度音程叠置而成。</li>\n<li>四种类型由两个三度的音程组合唯一确定：大三、小三、增三、减三。</li>\n<li>大三/小三因纯五度框架而稳定；增三/减三因五音偏移而带张力。</li>\n<li>自然大调各级天然产生固定分布：I、IV、V 大三，ii、iii、vi 小三，vii° 减三。</li>\n<li>转位改变低音与稳定性，但不改变和弦的根音与功能属性。</li>\n<li>古典数字低音、流行和弦符号、Nashville 数字三套标记可互相转译。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>三和弦由三度音程叠置而成，理解大三度、小三度的半音构成是前置基础：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/intervals\">音程体系</a></li>\n<li>调内各级三和弦的大小分布直接源自大小调音阶结构：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/scales-keys/major-minor-scales\">大小调音阶</a></li>\n<li>在此基础上继续向上叠加三度即得到七和弦，是和弦构建的下一步：<a href=\"seventh-chords\">七和弦体系</a></li>\n<li>Nashville 数字标记与首调唱名思路相通，可对照简谱体系：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/notation-systems/numbered-notation\">简谱与数字标记</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三和弦的构成与分类","id":"三和弦的构成与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三度叠置原理","id":"三度叠置原理"},{"level":2,"text":"四种三和弦类型","id":"四种三和弦类型"},{"level":2,"text":"调内三和弦的自然分布","id":"调内三和弦的自然分布"},{"level":2,"text":"三和弦的转位","id":"三和弦的转位"},{"level":2,"text":"和弦标记系统比较","id":"和弦标记系统比较"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"七和弦体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/chord-construction/seventh-chords"}}